```
POST /api/evaluate
Headers: X-API-Key: dev_api_key_12345
Body: {
  jobTitle: string,
  totalComp: number,
  baseSalary: number,
  bonus: number (months),
  equity: number,
  city: string,
  experience: string
}
Response: { score: number, breakdown: object, script: string, recommendation: string }
```

